       "      <td>104600</td>\n",
       "      <td>Portal 2 - The Final Hours</td>\n",
       "      <td>First of all, this is no game but a virtual interactive book, and a very good one as a matter of fact. To everyone who is interested in the behind the scenes of Portal 2, and how a development of a game works at Valve, you're in for one hell of a ride. I absolutely recommend it, it shows the everyday routine of an employee at Valve, some very enlightening points of view on their known delays a...</td>\n",
       "      <td>1</td>\n",
